  "question": {
    "text": "Let the circumcentre of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mi>S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and the midpoints of sides <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;respectively, then the equation of the circumcircle of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is"
  },
